## Capability

Open a supported finite-molecule file and select atoms, bonds and conformers by stable identity. Use native numeric and graphical edits and export the declared subset.

## Completion checks

- [ ] Edit a bond in the bounded SDF fixture, reopen and match the selected atoms after reordering. Report unsupported or lost stereochemical information.

